# Personal progress docs
进度文档/
# The progress document is the paper's method spec. Code changes that touch a
# method definition, a module behaviour, a hyperparameter or an experiment
# setting must update it in the same commit, so it is tracked. Older revisions
# stay untracked.
docx/*
!docx/胡宏彬-进度文档-20260818.docx

# Datasets: re-downloaded on first use by experiments/datasets.py
data/*.csv

# Per-window governance traces; regenerated by run_agent.py and large
results/*_traces.json

